---
// src/pages/index.astro
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>GeoMetrics — AI Search Visibility Benchmarks</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Independent GEO and AI search visibility benchmarks across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, Gemini, and Google AI Overviews. Pure measurement, no agency pitch."
    />
    <!-- Geometric 'G' Favicon -->
    <link
      rel="icon"
      type="image/svg+xml"
      href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' rx='8' fill='%232563eb'/%3E%3Ctext x='50%25' y='54%25' dominant-baseline='middle' text-anchor='middle' fill='%23ffffff' font-family='-apple-system, sans-serif' font-size='18' font-weight='700'%3EG%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E"
    />

    <!-- FAQPage Schema for Search Engines & LLMs -->
    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "How is AI visibility tracking different from Google SEO?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Google shows a fixed list of 10 blue links. AI engines write a fresh answer every time, weaving brand names into conversational recommendations. AI visibility tracking measures whether you get mentioned at all, how consistently you appear, and where you rank against competitors inside those answers."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Which AI engines does GeoMetrics benchmark?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "We track brand visibility across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, Google Gemini, and Google AI Overviews."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Do you also sell GEO or SEO optimization services?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "No. GeoMetrics is strictly an independent measurement service. We give you accurate ground-truth numbers on where your brand stands without trying to upsell agency retainers."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "How often do AI search answers change?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Much faster than traditional search. Model updates, new review articles, and fresh Reddit or news threads can shift which brands get recommended from one month to the next."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What do I get in the initial brand snapshot?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "You get a clear baseline showing your AI citation share, average answer position, top competing brands appearing in your category prompts, and the third-party sources driving those answers."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "How does recurring monthly tracking work?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Once you review your initial snapshot, you can opt into a recurring monthly benchmark. We re-run your core category prompts every month so you can see whether your visibility is climbing or slipping."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    </script>

    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #ffffff;
        --surface: #f8fafc;
        --surface-2: #f1f5f9;
        --border: #e2e8f0;
        --text: #0f172a;
        --muted: #475569;
        --accent: #2563eb;
        --accent-hover: #1d4ed8;
        --accent-soft: #eff6ff;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
          Inter, sans-serif;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.6;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 1080px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 24px;
      }

      /* 1. Sticky Navbar */
      header {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 50;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      .nav {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        height: 68px;
      }

      .logo {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        font-size: 1.12rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      .logo-mark {
        width: 28px;
        height: 28px;
        border-radius: 7px;
        background: var(--accent);
        color: #fff;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 28px;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .nav-links a:hover {
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .btn-nav {
        background: var(--text);
        color: #fff !important;
        padding: 9px 16px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
      }

      .btn-nav:hover {
        opacity: 0.88;
      }

      /* 2. Hero Section */
      .hero {
        padding: 72px 0 56px;
        background: radial-gradient(
          circle at 50% 0%,
          #eff6ff 0%,
          #ffffff 65%
        );
      }

      .hero-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
        gap: 48px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--accent);
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
        padding: 5px 12px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.2vw, 3.1rem);
        line-height: 1.12;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .hero-copy p {
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        max-width: 500px;
      }

      .hero-points {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
        font-size: 0.94rem;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .hero-points li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .check {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      /* Hero Form Card */
      .form-card {
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 28px;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      }

      .form-card-title {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }

      .form-card-sub {
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .form-group {
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      label {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      input {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 11px 13px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.94rem;
        background: var(--surface);
        color: var(--text);
        transition: border-color 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
      }

      input:focus {
        outline: none;
        border-color: var(--accent);
        background: #fff;
      }

      .btn-primary {
        width: 100%;
        margin-top: 6px;
        padding: 13px 20px;
        background: var(--accent);
        color: #fff;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.15s ease;
      }

      .btn-primary:hover {
        background: var(--accent-hover);
      }

      .btn-primary:disabled {
        opacity: 0.65;
        cursor: not-allowed;
      }

      .form-note {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 10px;
      }

      .status-box {
        display: none;
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .status-box strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: var(--text);
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .status-box p {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .error-msg {
        display: none;
        color: #dc2626;
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        margin-top: 10px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      /* 3. Platform Strip */
      .platform-strip {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: var(--surface);
        padding: 22px 0;
      }

      .strip-inner {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 14px 28px;
      }

      .strip-label {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .engine-pill {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--text);
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
      }

      /* Shared Section Styles */
      section.block {
        padding: 76px 0;
      }

      section.block.alt {
        background: var(--surface);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      .section-head {
        max-width: 640px;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: var(--accent);
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      h2 {
        font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.15rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        line-height: 1.2;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .section-sub {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      /* 4. Per-Engine Breakdown (4 Cards) */
      .grid-4 {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .card {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 24px;
      }

      .engine-tag {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--accent);
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        padding: 4px 10px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      .card h3 {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }

      .card p {
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      /* 5. How It Works (4 Steps) */
      .step-num {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--accent);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }

      /* 6. 6-Card Metrics Grid */
      .grid-3 {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(290px, 1fr));
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .kpi-card {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 24px;
      }

      .kpi-card h3 {
        font-size: 1.04rem;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .kpi-card p {
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      /* 7. FAQ Section */
      .faq-list {
        max-width: 780px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      details {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 18px 22px;
      }

      summary {
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.98rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }

      summary::-webkit-details-marker {
        display: none;
      }

      summary::after {
        content: "+";
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      details[open] summary::after {
        content: "−";
      }

      details p {
        margin-top: 12px;
        font-size: 0.93rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      /* 8. Bottom CTA Banner */
      .cta-banner {
        background: var(--text);
        color: #fff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 52px 36px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .cta-banner h2 {
        color: #fff;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .cta-banner p {
        color: #cbd5e1;
        max-width: 560px;
        margin: 0 auto 28px;
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .btn-light {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #fff;
        color: var(--text);
        padding: 13px 26px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
      }

      .btn-light:hover {
        opacity: 0.92;
      }

      /* 9. Multi-Column Footer */
      footer {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 56px 0 36px;
        background: var(--surface);
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .footer-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 32px;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
      }

      .footer-col h4 {
        color: var(--text);
        font-size: 0.86rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .footer-col ul {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .footer-col a:hover {
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .footer-bottom {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding-top: 24px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 820px) {
        .hero-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .nav-links a:not(.btn-nav):not(.nav-blog) {
          display: none;
        }
        .footer-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 520px) {
        .footer-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <!-- 1. Top Navbar -->
    <header>
      <div class="container nav">
        <a href="/" class="logo">
          <span class="logo-mark">G</span>
          GeoMetrics
        </a>
        <nav class="nav-links">
          <a href="#platforms">Platforms</a>
          <a href="#how-it-works">How It Works</a>
          <a href="#metrics">Metrics</a>
          <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
          <a href="/blog" class="nav-blog">Blog</a>
          <a href="#request" class="btn-nav">Check Your Brand</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <!-- 2. Hero Section -->
      <section class="hero" id="request">
        <div class="container hero-grid">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <span class="badge">Independent AI Search Intelligence</span>
            <h1>Know where your brand stands in AI search.</h1>
            <p>
              People are asking ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Gemini what to buy. We
              show you if your brand shows up, where you rank, and which
              competitors are beating you—pure visibility data, no agency pitch.
            </p>
            <ul class="hero-points">
              <li>
                <span class="check">✓</span> Benchmarked across 5 major AI
                answer engines
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="check">✓</span> See exact competitor share of voice
                and cited sources
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="check">✓</span> Start with a single baseline
                snapshot—no setup required
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Inline Waitlist Form -->
          <div class="form-card">
            <div class="form-card-title">Request your brand snapshot</div>
            <p class="form-card-sub">
              Leave your details below. We'll add you to the list and get back
              to you.
            </p>

            <form
              id="waitlist-form"
              action="https://formspree.io/f/xyewbbne"
              method="POST"
            >
              <div class="form-group">
                <label for="brand">Brand / Website</label>
                <input
                  type="text"
                  id="brand"
                  name="brand"
                  placeholder="e.g. yourbrand.com"
                  required
                />
              </div>

              <div class="form-group">
                <label for="product">Product / Category</label>
                <input
                  type="text"
                  id="product"
                  name="product"
                  placeholder="e.g. CRM Software, Running Shoes"
                  required
                />
              </div>

              <div class="form-group">
                <label for="email">Work Email</label>
                <input
                  type="email"
                  id="email"
                  name="email"
                  placeholder="you@company.com"
                  required
                />
              </div>

              <div class="form-group">
                <label for="phone">Phone / WhatsApp (Optional)</label>
                <input
                  type="tel"
                  id="phone"
                  name="phone"
                  placeholder="+91 ..."
                />
              </div>

              <button type="submit" id="submit-btn" class="btn-primary">
                Join Waitlist
              </button>
              <p class="form-note">
                No payment required. Zero spam.
              </p>
              <p class="error-msg" id="error-msg">
                Something went wrong. Please try again.
              </p>
            </form>

            <div class="status-box" id="status-box">
              <strong>You're on the waitlist.</strong>
              <p>
                We've received your details and will get back to you soon.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. Platform Strip -->
      <div class="platform-strip">
        <div class="container strip-inner">
          <span class="strip-label">Benchmarked across leading answer engines</span>
          <span class="engine-pill">ChatGPT</span>
          <span class="engine-pill">Perplexity</span>
          <span class="engine-pill">Claude</span>
          <span class="engine-pill">Google Gemini</span>
          <span class="engine-pill">AI Overviews</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Per-Engine Breakdown -->
      <section class="block" id="platforms">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div class="eyebrow">Platform Coverage</div>
            <h2>Visibility measured by AI engine.</h2>
            <p class="section-sub">
              Each model pulls from different sources and recommends different
              brands. We break your performance down engine by engine.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid-4">
            <div class="card">
              <span class="engine-tag">ChatGPT</span>
              <h3>ChatGPT Visibility</h3>
              <p>
                See how often ChatGPT mentions your brand in buying prompts, how
                it describes your strengths, and who appears ahead of you.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <span class="engine-tag">Perplexity</span>
              <h3>Perplexity Citations</h3>
              <p>
                Track which brands Perplexity recommends and the exact web
                sources it links to when answering questions in your category.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <span class="engine-tag">Claude</span>
              <h3>Claude Recommendations</h3>
              <p>
                Check whether Claude includes your product in head-to-head
                comparisons and how your positioning stacks up against rivals.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <span class="engine-tag">Google AI</span>
              <h3>Gemini & AI Overviews</h3>
              <p>
                Measure your presence inside Google's AI-generated summaries and
                Gemini answers for high-intent commercial queries.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 5. How It Works (4 Steps) -->
      <section class="block alt" id="how-it-works">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div class="eyebrow">How It Works</div>
            <h2>From your URL to a clear AI baseline.</h2>
            <p class="section-sub">
              No dashboards to configure or scripts to install on your site.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid-4">
            <div class="card">
              <div class="step-num">01 / SHARE</div>
              <h3>Share your brand & product</h3>
              <p>
                Submit your website and core product category using the form
                above.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <div class="step-num">02 / QUERY</div>
              <h3>We run category prompts</h3>
              <p>
                We test real buyer questions across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude,
                Gemini, and AI Overviews.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <div class="step-num">03 / ANALYZE</div>
              <h3>We map mentions & sources</h3>
              <p>
                Every response is parsed for brand mentions, rank order,
                competing brands, and cited domains.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <div class="step-num">04 / REPORT</div>
              <h3>Receive your baseline</h3>
              <p>
                We send you a clean, readable snapshot showing exactly where you
                stand today.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 6. 6-Card Metrics Grid -->
      <section class="block" id="metrics">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div class="eyebrow">What We Measure</div>
            <h2>What’s inside a GeoMetrics benchmark.</h2>
            <p class="section-sub">
              Six core KPIs built for founders, growth leads, and marketing
              teams who want ground-truth numbers first.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid-3">
            <div class="kpi-card">
              <h3>AI Citation Share</h3>
              <p>
                The percentage of high-intent category prompts where AI models
                explicitly mention or recommend your brand.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="kpi-card">
              <h3>Answer Positioning</h3>
              <p>
                Whether you show up as the #1 recommendation, buried at the
                bottom of a list, or left out completely.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="kpi-card">
              <h3>Competitor Share of Voice</h3>
              <p>
                A side-by-side breakdown of which competitors are capturing AI
                recommendations in your category.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="kpi-card">
              <h3>Cited Source Audit</h3>
              <p>
                The exact third-party articles, review sites, and domains that
                AI engines rely on to form their answers.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="kpi-card">
